--- !u!114 &1472154231
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1472154230}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 2 | Ders 10 | I\u015F\u0131k ve G\xF6lge"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin sonundaki durumdur. I\u015F\u0131k haritas\u0131 pi\u015Firilmi\u015Ftir.
    Kure nesnesini Play modunda s\xFCr\xFCkleyerek pi\u015Firilmi\u015F odada nas\u0131l
    ayd\u0131nland\u0131\u011F\u0131na bak\u0131n.\n\nK\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir oday\u0131
    ayd\u0131nlat\u0131yoruz. \xD6nce y\xF6nl\xFC \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    a\xE7\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve rengini de\u011Fi\u015Ftiriyor, sonra noktasal ve
    spot \u0131\u015F\u0131k ekliyoruz. I\u015F\u0131klar\u0131 Baked moduna al\u0131p
    bir \u0131\u015F\u0131k haritas\u0131 pi\u015Firiyor, hareketli nesnenin pi\u015Firilmi\u015F
    odada nas\u0131l ayd\u0131nland\u0131\u011F\u0131na bak\u0131yor ve g\xF6lge
    ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 d\xFCzenliyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders10_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n ve Directional Light nesnesini se\xE7in.
    Rotation X de\u011Ferini 10 ile 80 aras\u0131nda gezdirin, g\xF6lgeler uzar ve
    k\u0131sal\u0131r. Color alan\u0131ndan s\u0131cak bir turuncu se\xE7in."
  - "Hierarchy'de sa\u011F t\u0131klay\u0131n, Light men\xFCs\xFCnden Point Light
    ekleyin ve odan\u0131n ortas\u0131na, duvarlar\u0131n \xFCst hizas\u0131na yerle\u015Ftirin.
    Range de\u011Ferini 10 yap\u0131n ve Intensity de\u011Ferini art\u0131r\u0131n."
  - "Light men\xFCs\xFCnden Spot Light ekleyin ve k\xFCreye do\u011Frultun. Spot
    Angle de\u011Ferini 30 yerine 90 yap\u0131n. Inner ve Outer a\xE7\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n
    \u0131\u015F\u0131k konisini nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Ftirdi\u011Fine bak\u0131n."
  - "Directional Light nesnesinin Mode alan\u0131nda Realtime, Mixed ve Baked se\xE7eneklerini
    s\u0131rayla inceleyin ve Baked se\xE7in. Point Light ve Spot Light nesnelerini
    de Baked yap\u0131n."
  - "Window men\xFCs\xFCnden Rendering, Lighting penceresini a\xE7\u0131n. Lightmap
    Resolution de\u011Ferini 10 yap\u0131n ve Generate Lighting d\xFC\u011Fmesine
    bas\u0131n. Sa\u011F alttaki ilerleme \xE7ubu\u011Funu izleyin. Pi\u015Firme
    bitince odan\u0131n k\xF6\u015Felerindeki dolayl\u0131 \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011Fa
    ve yumu\u015Fak g\xF6lgelere bak\u0131n."
  - "Kure nesnesini se\xE7in ve Static i\u015Faretini kald\u0131r\u0131n. Play tu\u015Funa
    bas\u0131n ve k\xFCreyi Scene penceresinde s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. K\xFCre pi\u015Firilmi\u015F
    odada ayd\u0131nlanmaya devam eder. Lighting penceresinde Adaptive Probe Volumes
    b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCne bak\u0131n."
  - "Directional Light nesnesini yeniden Mixed yap\u0131n. G\xF6lge ayarlar\u0131nda
    Bias de\u011Ferini 0 yap\u0131n, zeminde \xE7izgili g\xF6lge lekeleri olu\u015Fur.
    De\u011Feri 1 yap\u0131n, k\xFCp\xFCn g\xF6lgesi taban\u0131ndan kopar. De\u011Feri
    ikisinin aras\u0131nda bir yere getirin."
  kendinDene:
  - "Lightmap Resolution de\u011Ferini 40 yap\u0131p yeniden pi\u015Firin. G\xF6lge
    kenarlar\u0131 ve pi\u015Firme s\xFCresi nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Fiyor?"
  - "Bir k\xFCp\xFCn Static i\u015Faretini kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden pi\u015Firin.
    K\xFCp\xFCn g\xF6lgesi \u0131\u015F\u0131k haritas\u0131nda kal\u0131yor mu?"
  - "Window men\xFCs\xFCnden Rendering, Lighting penceresinde Environment sekmesini
    a\xE7\u0131n ve Intensity Multiplier de\u011Ferini 0 yap\u0131n. Oda nas\u0131l
    g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor?"
